      "cooked": "<p>Yes, that’s exactly my problem. Though my issue is that my currency doesn’t use cents but rounded numbers. And the difference is a whole unit.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/5/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4_2_690x111.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"9Y2d8MxqhFJ8RYjla7mHb4ov4eo\" width=\"690\" height=\"111\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4_2_690x111.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4_2_1035x166.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/5/45dce541c9c5472d27651a44e2f8ff4345f071d4_2_1380x222.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"292929\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1558×252 22 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I can live with that too, but ERPNext doesn’t allow me to submit that invoice.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/3/339989a5a8dffd0340240df8a6cb05e23c11e83f.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/339989a5a8dffd0340240df8a6cb05e23c11e83f\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/3/3/339989a5a8dffd0340240df8a6cb05e23c11e83f.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"7mtiQr56FKulHMauuoUACUGbMfl\" width=\"690\" height=\"156\" data-dominant-color=\"222222\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1120×254 9.17 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>The rounding solution you propose would work I suppose. But there are a couple of tax accounts and apparently te round off account only has space for 1.</p>",
